/-!
# Extensional equality on the step, outside the knowledge

The knowledge of `Interface.DependentFull.step` equates terms up to typed βη conversion and stays
that way here: no rule, constant or equation is added to it. Extensional equality of sets lives in
rows, as proof-relevant evidence made by firings, and is used by firings.

* `Codes`: `setEq S T = Π (X : U0). Σ (_ : S X → T X). (T X → S X)`, computed from the codes of the
  two sets; comprehension is definitional (`s_beta`, `t_beta`); `λX. (f X, g X)` proves `setEq S T`
  from a forward and a backward map (`evidence_typed`); `respType` is what a family needs to be
  transported.
* `Run`: on the sets `S = λX. Σ X Ground` and `T = λX. Σ Ground X`, the extensionality rule reads the
  two swaps and makes the equality row; the transport rule reads it and the member `(x, g) : X ∈ S`
  and makes `X ∈ T`; both are admitted, form a run, and afterwards the knowledge still refuses
  `S ≐ T`.
* `Computation`: the transported member is `(g, x) : T X` in the knowledge; the two swaps are mutually
  inverse in the knowledge, so the evidence is an equivalence.
* `Transport`: for every family with a respect term, classified by a substitution into the universal
  frame `Omega`, transport is admitted and builds its member from the rows it reads; membership is an
  instance.
* `Controls`: a predicate on codes and the intensional identity family of a set have no respect term
  (the latter by η-long normal forms); absence does not transport; transport only makes rows.
* `Quotient`: classes of sets as names; soundness as a firing that reads the evidence and tells only
  an equation between names; counting reads through it after, and not before.
* `SetTheory`: comprehension, intersection (limit F4 is the commutativity of intersection),
  reflexivity, symmetry and transitivity of `setEq`, union one universe up, and non-membership with
  its respect term.
* `Options`: the designs of extensional equality and their consequences. `Observability`: queries
  see exactly the identifications a knowledge entails. `Respect`, `RespectCoherence`,
  `RespectComposition`: respect terms generated by type structure, typed, coherent along reflexivity
  and composition, with the identity family outside. `Observational` and `Univalent`: the two
  options that change equality itself, worked out in models. `QuotientDiscipline`: a publication
  discipline under which class equations are witnessed. `Consequences`: the table.
-/
